    "customfield_12311020": null,
    "customfield_12313320": "<div style='font-weight:bold;color:red;text-align:center'>This project has a <a href=\"https://lucene.apache.org/core/discussion.html\">user mailing list and an IRC channel</a> for support. If you are looking for support, or if you are not sure whether the behavior that you are observing is expected or not, please discuss it there first.</div>",
    "customfield_12314134": null,
    "duedate": null,
    "customfield_12314132": null,
    "customfield_12314131": null,
    "comment": {
      "comments": [
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12362897/comment/12473316",
          "id": "12473316",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=doronc",
            "name": "doronc",
            "key": "doronc",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=doronc&avatarId=12738",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=doronc&avatarId=12738",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=doronc&avatarId=12738",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=doronc&avatarId=12738"
            },
            "displayName": "Doron Cohen",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Asia/Gaza"
          },
          "body": "This can be easily fixed like this:\n\nIndex: build.xml\n===================================================================\n--- build.xml   (revision 507610)\n+++ build.xml   (working copy)\n@@ -37,7 +37,7 @@\n\n   <patternset id=\"src.dist.patterns\"\n               includes=\"src/,build.xml,*build*.xml,docs/,*.txt,contrib/,\"\n-              excludes=\"contrib/*/lib/,src/site/build/\"\n+              excludes=\"contrib/db/*/lib/,contrib/*/ext-libs/,src/site/build/\"\n   />\n   <patternset id=\"binary.build.dist.patterns\"\n               includes=\"${final.name}.jar,${demo.war.name}.war,${demo.name}.jar,docs/,contrib/*/*.jar\"\n\nA nicer fix would be to also modify contrib/db to have ext-libs rather than lib (like gdata), but \nfor not holding 2.1 this is good enough I think. \n\nRunning \"ant -Dversion=2.1.0 dist dist-src\" like this and unpacking the src.zip, reults in\nthe same content as a clean \"svn co\" (except for the unwanted index.html\").",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=doronc",
            "name": "doronc",
            "key": "doronc",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=doronc&avatarId=12738",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=doronc&avatarId=12738",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=doronc&avatarId=12738",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=doronc&avatarId=12738"
            },
            "displayName": "Doron Cohen",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Asia/Gaza"
          },
          "created": "2007-02-15T08:01:26.037+0000",
          "updated": "2007-02-15T08:01:26.037+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12362897/comment/12473424",
          "id": "12473424",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=doronc",
            "name": "doronc",
            "key": "doronc",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=doronc&avatarId=12738",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=doronc&avatarId=12738",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=doronc&avatarId=12738",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=doronc&avatarId=12738"
            },
            "displayName": "Doron Cohen",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Asia/Gaza"
          },
          "body": "804.build.xml.patch removes loadable jars from the src_dist\nand adds back in jars that are (currently) not downloadable. This \nallows src_dist to compile contribs (or even to \"re-dist\").\n\nsrc-dist size effect of this - reduced from 8.9 MB to 6.8 MB.\n",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=doronc",
            "name": "doronc",
            "key": "doronc",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=doronc&avatarId=12738",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=doronc&avatarId=12738",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=doronc&avatarId=12738",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=doronc&avatarId=12738"
            },
            "displayName": "Doron Cohen",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Asia/Gaza"
          },
          "created": "2007-02-15T16:46:47.620+0000",
          "updated": "2007-02-15T16:46:47.620+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12362897/comment/12473869",
          "id": "12473869",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=doronc",
            "name": "doronc",
            "key": "doronc",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=doronc&avatarId=12738",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=doronc&avatarId=12738",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=doronc&avatarId=12738",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=doronc&avatarId=12738"
            },
            "displayName": "Doron Cohen",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Asia/Gaza"
          },
          "body": "[1]  Modifying 'fix version' to not be 2.1, thereby clarifying that,\nsince releases are to be more frequent, this should not be \nregarded as a stopper to release 2.1.\n\n[2]  I would like to commit this in a day or so (unless anyone \npoints a problem with this).\n",
